      "selection_reason": "Potential editorial aid: the isomorphism decomposes Chow groups into tautological powers pulled back from X and gives the projection identities that recover coefficients.",
      "concrete_diagram_content_or_checks": "\u03c0:P(E)\u2192X with quotient convention and \u03be=c1(O(1)); map (\u03b1\u2080,\u2026,\u03b1\u1d63\u208b\u2081) \u21a6 \u03a3 \u03be\u2071\u2229\u03c0*\u03b1\u1d62; \u03c0*(\u03be\u02e2\u2229\u03c0*\u03b1)=0 for s<r\u22121 and \u03b1 at s=r\u22121. Check rank/index convention.",
      "line_ranges": [
